{"data": {"event": {"id": "5142ef4a-b339-4d65-bb4b-8b59ff9fff4d", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/1062/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "L\u2019 \u00e9chographie du foie en 2026", "start": "2026-10-10T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T15:00+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Ma\u00eetriser les principes fondamentaux du mode B et du Doppler puls\u00e9</strong> et reconna\u00eetre leur int\u00e9r\u00eat diagnostique dans la pratique actuelle de l\u2019\u00e9chographie.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Appliquer les r\u00e8gles d\u2019utilisation et d\u2019interpr\u00e9tation des techniques \u00e9chographiques</strong>, afin d\u2019optimiser la qualit\u00e9 des examens et la pertinence des r\u00e9sultats.</li>", "\t<li><strong>\u00c9valuer les apports actuels et futurs des nouvelles techniques \u00e9chographiques</strong>, notamment pour la quantification de la st\u00e9atose h\u00e9patique, et identifier les \u00e9volutions susceptibles de transformer la pratique de l\u2019\u00e9chographie.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "0d424772-aa4d-491e-97e5-d79be067453c", "name": "241", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "e935dc9c-18ce-4ce6-a2c7-917070e3a987", "title": "Hier : Le mode B et le doppler puls\u00e9 \u00ab \u00e0 l\u2019ancienne \u00bb restent utiles", "start": "2026-10-10T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T14:12+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "08dcb405-6a6b-48d7-90f3-0ebb5a525baf", "lastName": "Lucidarme", "firstName": "Olivier", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphot